          "weight": 7,
          "featured": false,
          "content": {
            "en": {
              "label": "Can ACCSYSTEM handle multi-level bill of materials for complex products?",
              "text": "Yes. The production costing module supports multi-level BOMs with sub-assemblies, routing steps, and overhead absorption rates. Actual versus standard cost variances are calculated at each BOM level."
            },
            "ar": {
              "text": "Yes. The production costing module supports multi-level BOMs with sub-assemblies, routing steps, and overhead absorption rates. Actual versus standard cost variances are calculated at each BOM level.",
              "label": "Can ACCSYSTEM handle multi-level bill of materials for complex products?"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "00500b11-0005-0000-0000-000000000001",
          "type": "feature_item",
          "position": 5,
          "weight": 7,
          "featured": false,
          "content": {
            "en": {
              "label": "How does the system handle work-in-progress valuation?",
              "text": "WIP is valued at actual tracked cost at each production stage. You can configure the costing method — standard cost, actual cost, or weighted average — per product category or facility."
            },
            "ar": {
              "text": "WIP is valued at actual tracked cost at each production stage. You can configure the costing method — standard cost, actual cost, or weighted average — per product category or facility.",
              "label": "How does the system handle work-in-progress valuation?"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "00500b11-0006-0000-0000-000000000001",
          "type": "feature_item",
          "position": 6,
          "weight": 7,
          "featured": false,
          "content": {
            "en": {
              "label": "Does it support batch and lot tracking for regulatory traceability?",
              "text": "Full batch and lot tracking is available, recording raw material inputs, production parameters, and finished goods outputs per batch. This supports recalls, quality investigations, and regulatory traceability requirements."
            },
            "ar": {
              "text": "Full batch and lot tracking is available, recording raw material inputs, production parameters, and finished goods outputs per batch. This supports recalls, quality investigations, and regulatory traceability requirements.",
              "label": "Does it support batch and lot tracking for regulatory traceability?"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "00500b11-0007-0000-0000-000000000001",
          "type": "feature_item",
          "position": 7,
          "weight": 7,
          "featured": false,
          "content": {
            "en": {
              "label": "Can it manage capital asset depreciation across multiple methods?",
              "text": "Yes. ACCSYSTEM supports straight-line, reducing balance, and units-of-production depreciation methods per asset category, with automatic depreciation posting and disposal gain/loss calculation."
            },
            "ar": {
              "text": "Yes. ACCSYSTEM supports straight-line, reducing balance, and units-of-production depreciation methods per asset category, with automatic depreciation posting and disposal gain/loss calculation.",
              "label": "Can it manage capital asset depreciation across multiple methods?"
